---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import OperatingSystemVisual from '../components/OperatingSystemVisual.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Trouvus | Research-Grounded AI Transformation" description="Trouvus helps leaders decide where AI creates value, redesign work around it and govern the path from hypothesis to scalable capability.">
  <section class="hero">
    <canvas class="hero-canvas" data-variant="network"></canvas>
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">AI transformation strategy and implementation</div>
        <h1>Turn AI ambition into operating capability.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Trouvus helps leaders decide where AI creates value, redesign work around it, and govern the path from first hypothesis to scalable capability.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn accent" href="/contact/?interest=diagnostic">Request an Executive AI Value Diagnostic</a>
          <a class="btn secondary" href="/approach/">Explore the Strategy-to-Scale Framework</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <OperatingSystemVisual />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="authority-band" aria-label="Trouvus foundations">
    <div class="wrap authority-strip">
      <div class="authority-item"><span>01</span><strong>Peer-reviewed foundations</strong></div>
      <div class="authority-item"><span>02</span><strong>Proprietary transformation frameworks</strong></div>
      <div class="authority-item"><span>03</span><strong>Executive-education perspective</strong></div>
      <div class="authority-item"><span>04</span><strong>Investment-informed judgment</strong></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rule">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">The 2026 enterprise reality</div>
      <h2>Individual AI gains are rising. Enterprise value still depends on operating redesign.</h2>
      <div class="stat-grid">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="kicker">McKinsey Global Survey · August 2026</div>
          <div class="stat-number">80%</div>
          <p class="muted small">of respondents say AI has improved their individual productivity.</p>
          <a class="source-link" href="https://www.mckinsey.com/capabilities/quantumblack/our-insights/the-state-of-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the 2026 survey →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="kicker">McKinsey Global Survey · August 2026</div>
          <div class="stat-number">37%</div>
          <p class="muted small">report that AI has contributed positively to their organization’s EBIT.</p>
          <a class="source-link" href="https://www.mckinsey.com/capabilities/quantumblack/our-insights/the-state-of-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">See the enterprise-impact findings →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="kicker">McKinsey Global Survey · August 2026</div>
          <div class="stat-number">6%</div>
          <p class="muted small">qualify as AI high performers, reporting significant value and at least 5% EBIT impact from AI.</p>
          <a class="source-link" href="https://www.mckinsey.com/capabilities/quantumblack/our-insights/the-state-of-ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Review what high performers do differently →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:14px">Based on 1,719 survey participants across 97 nations; fielded May–June 2026.</p>
      <div class="grid-3" style="margin-top:26px">
        <div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-strategy.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Disconnected strategy</h3><p class="muted">Tools deployed without clear business-model integration.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-bizmodel.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Unchanged workflows</h3><p class="muted">Automation layered over outdated operating processes.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-workforce.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Atrophied capability</h3><p class="muted">Workforce skills replaced rather than augmented.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">The transformation journey</div>
      <h2>Three moves. One operating system.</h2>
      <div class="stepper">
        <div class="stepper-tabs">
          <button class="stepper-tab active" data-tab="1">01 Decide</button>
          <button class="stepper-tab" data-tab="2">02 Design &amp; deploy</button>
          <button class="stepper-tab" data-tab="3">03 Adopt &amp; scale</button>
        </div>
        <div class="stepper-panel active" data-panel="1"><div><h3>Decide where AI creates defensible value</h3><p class="muted">Identify the opportunities that matter, prioritize them against value, feasibility, risk and readiness, and build a credible transformation roadmap.</p><a class="card-cta" href="/expertise/#strategy">AI strategy and roadmaps →</a></div><img src="/images/icon-strategy.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" width="110" height="110"></div>
        <div class="stepper-panel" data-panel="2"><div><h3>Redesign the work, then deploy</h3><p class="muted">Redesign business models, decisions and workflows; define bounded pilots; govern implementation against measurable outcomes.</p><a class="card-cta" href="/expertise/#implementation">Implementation and pilots →</a></div><img src="/images/icon-implementation.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" width="110" height="110"></div>
        <div class="stepper-panel" data-panel="3"><div><h3>Build the organization that scales it</h3><p class="muted">Develop leadership alignment, workforce capability, governance and the operating disciplines required to scale beyond the pilot.</p><a class="card-cta" href="/expertise/#workforce">Workforce transformation →</a></div><img src="/images/icon-workforce.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="" width="110" height="110"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rule">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Our point of view</div>
        <h2>Transformation must redesign the system—not simply add tools.</h2>
        <img class="pov-visual" src="/images/pov-steps.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Four moves: strategic value, redesign work, build capability, measure outcomes" width="620" height="190">
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2">
        <div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-strategy.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Start with strategic value</h3><p class="muted">Technology selection follows opportunity prioritization, operating logic and evidence.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-bizmodel.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Redesign work</h3><p class="muted">AI should improve decisions, workflows and value creation—not merely accelerate isolated tasks.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-workforce.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Build capability</h3><p class="muted">Every pilot should strengthen leadership judgment, workforce competence and institutional learning.</p></div>
        <div class="card"><img class="icon" src="/images/icon-implementation.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><h3>Measure outcomes</h3><p class="muted">Success is assessed through operating, strategic and organizational results rather than activity.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Strategy-to-Scale Framework</div>
      <h2>From strategic uncertainty to scalable capability.</h2>
      <div class="pipeline">
        <div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Uncover true capability constraints across data, technology and governance.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-diagnose.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">01</div><h3>Diagnose</h3></div>
        <div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Convert fragmented use-case lists into a ranked, governed portfolio.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-prioritize.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">02</div><h3>Prioritize</h3></div>
        <div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Define workflows, decision rights and human-augmented boundaries.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-design.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">03</div><h3>Design</h3></div>
        <div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Run bounded tests with strict scale-or-stop decision rules.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-pilot.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">04</div><h3>Pilot</h3></div>
        <div class="pipe-node" tabindex="0"><span class="tip">Institutionalize processes, controls and continuous workforce learning.</span><img class="stage-icon" src="/images/stage-scale.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt=""><div class="num">05</div><h3>Scale</h3></div>
      </div>
      <p class="small muted" style="margin-top:14px">Hover or focus each stage for its executive output. <a href="/approach/" class="card-cta">Full framework →</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="rule">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow">Intellectual assets</div>
      <h2>Frameworks that make transformation decisions visible.</h2>
      <div class="grid-3">
        <div class="card tactile glass"><img src="/images/readiness-diagnostic.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic" width="640" height="300"><h3>AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic</h3><p>Assesses strategic alignment, data, technology, governance and workforce capability.</p></div>
        <div class="card tactile glass"><img src="/images/habmc.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Human-Augmented Business Model Canvas" width="640" height="300"><h3>Human-Augmented Business Model Canvas</h3><p>Examines how AI changes value creation while preserving critical human agency.</p></div>
        <div class="card tactile glass"><img src="/images/strategy-to-scale.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Strategy-to-Scale Framework" width="640" height="300"><h3>Pilot Passport</h3><p>Defines a pilot’s hypothesis, scope, owners, controls, metrics and scale decision.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="authority-section">
    <div class="wrap split authority-layout">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Research, method and judgment</div>
        <h2>Serious transformation requires more than technical enthusiasm.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Trouvus combines academic research, structured transformation methods and investment-informed judgment to help leaders make better decisions about where—and where not—to deploy AI.</p>
        <img class="control-center-visual" src="/images/control-center.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="Trouvus transformation diagnostic: five-dimension readiness radar and governed portfolio view" width="640" height="460">
      </div>
      <div class="authority-cards">
        <div class="card proof"><div class="badge violet">Inspectable evidence</div><h3>Built on published research</h3><p class="muted">Ideas are grounded in peer-reviewed work and established business-model frameworks—not vendor hype or unsupported certainty.</p></div>
        <div class="card proof"><div class="badge green">Proprietary methods</div><h3>Ideas converted into decision systems</h3><p class="muted">Diagnostics, canvases and Pilot Passports turn abstract strategy into explicit choices, ownership and evidence requirements.</p></div>
        <div class="card proof"><div class="badge blue">Enterprise-value lens</div><h3>Technology evaluated through value</h3><p class="muted">AI opportunities are examined against strategic relevance, operating feasibility, risk, readiness and capital discipline.</p></div>
        <div class="card proof"><div class="badge amber">Governed experimentation</div><h3>Scale-or-stop logic before build</h3><p class="muted">Every pilot begins with a bounded hypothesis, accountable owners and a pre-committed decision rule.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap diagnostic-offer">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Executive AI Value Diagnostic</div>
        <h2>Turn uncertainty into a governed next decision.</h2>
        <p class="lead">A focused 90-minute working session for leaders who need to distinguish a credible AI opportunity from a costly distraction.</p>
        <a class="btn accent" href="/contact/?interest=diagnostic">Request the diagnostic</a>
      </div>
      <div class="diagnostic-outputs" aria-label="Diagnostic outputs">
        <div><span>01</span><strong>Preliminary strategic-opportunity map</strong></div>
        <div><span>02</span><strong>Readiness and risk screen</strong></div>
        <div><span>03</span><strong>One recommended scale-or-stop next step</strong></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
